## Limitations

Only qualifying laps. The public feed comes at about {{ data.rate_hz }} Hz, the brake is only on or off (no pressure), and the
position data are too coarse to see racing lines. The 2025 test had just five team changers, so H4 could only pass
if all five agreed, and H5 rests on {{ h5.all.n }} drivers and part of a season ({{ h5.data.built }} sessions with data, up to {{ h5.data.last }}). The
report goes through these and a few more.

